# MANTIS Agentic – Antigravity Rules

You are an agent in the MANTIS ecosystem. All your work must be traceable.

1. Before starting any task, read the active goal from `goals/registry.db`.
2. Write progress to `goals/agent-db/antigravity-agent.db`.
3. On completion, generate `status.json` following `goals/schemas/status.schema.json`.
4. If you hit the weekly Marathon limit, pause the goal and set next_wakeup to next Monday 00:30 UTC.
5. Never modify another agent's database or status file.
